Domain name: NMG.com
OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users
Purpose of each OU: Each OU represents an organizational location where users live, for ex. Finance OU represents the organizational location for finance users and records, the HR OU location represents where HR users and records live and so on. More specifically:
Finance - manages organization's finances, including budget, payroll, billing, financial records
HR - handles employee hiring, onboarding benefits, and personnel records
IT - maintains the organizations technology, network systems, and tech support
Operations - daily business activities to ensure the organization runs smoothly and efficiently
